@startuml
title Admin User Flow (AH-OSP-admin)
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "Browser (Vue SPA)" as Browser
participant "Laravel (BFF)" as BFF
participant "Microsoft Entra ID" as EntraID
participant "External APIs" as API
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache

== Admin Authentication & Authorization ==

Admin -> Browser: Access Admin Portal
Browser -> BFF: GET /admin
BFF -> EntraID: Check Entra ID Token & Roles (RBAC)
alt User lacks Admin Role
    BFF -> Browser: 403 Forbidden / Redirect to User Home
else User has Admin Role
    BFF -> Browser: Render Admin Dashboard (Inertia)
end

== Context Switching (Scelta Cliente / Struttura) ==

note over Admin, BFF: Admins can view data across different clients/facilities
Admin -> Browser: Open invoices (Fatture) or orders (Storico Ordini)
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/admin/clients
BFF -> API: GET /admin/clients (Fetch accessible clients for admin)
API -> BFF: List of Clients & Structures
BFF -> Browser: Display Client Selection

Admin -> Browser: Select specific Client/Structure & Search
Browser -> BFF: GET /api/invoices?client_id=X&struttura_id=Y
BFF -> API: GET /invoices with explicit context (client_id=X)
API -> BFF: Targeted Data Result
BFF -> Browser: Display Results (PDF/Excel download available)

== Administration Panel (Amministrazione) ==

note over Admin, API: Specific operations like Gestione Utenti, Offerte, Importazioni

Admin -> Browser: Upload "Ospedaliero" Import File
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/admin/import (Multipart form-data)
BFF -> API: Stream file to Processing Service
API -> BFF: Import Job Queued / Started
BFF -> Browser: Success Notification

Admin -> Browser: Update Offers / News (Gestione Offerte)
Browser -> BFF: POST /api/admin/offers
BFF -> API: POST /offers (Update promotional space)
API -> BFF: Offer updated
BFF -> Cache: Invalidate existing banners/news cache
Cache --> BFF: Cache Cleared
BFF -> Browser: Update Confirmation

@enduml
